    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this well maintained extended three bedroom cottage, enjoying a truly fabulous setting with breathtaking panoramic views over Dungarvan Bay, the Comeragh Mountains and the surrounding countryside. A particular feature of this property is the spacious glazed balcony off the living room, perfectly positioned to maximise the spectacular views and provide an ideal space to relax and enjoy the tranquil surroundings. Externally, the property is further enhanced by landscaped gardens complemented with a raised, sunny seating area again capturing the fabulous views. A spacious garden room together with a garage, offers excellent additional storage and workspace. Ideally located within approximately 8 minutes drive of Dungarvan town centre, this charming home offers the perfect combination of a tranquil countryside setting and convenient access to the town and its excellent range of amenities, to include schools, shops, award-winning restaurants, cafs and pubs. Numerous beautiful beaches, sporting facilities and the Waterford Greenway are also within easy reach. The accommodation extending to 90 sq.m comprises Entrance Porch, Livingrooom having Balcony off, Kitchen, Dining Room, 3 Bedrooms, Bathroom. External: Garden Room, Garage, Garden Shed. REA Spratt highly recommend viewing of this home. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Porch\n2.94m x 1.38m Fully glazed, Tiled floor, door to diningroom\n\nDining Area\n3.94m x 3.47m Dual aspect, timber flooring, floor unit\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Area\n3.98m x 1.82m Floor units, extractor, plumbed for dishwasher, timber flooring, views over Dungarvan Bay\n\nLiving Room\n7.30m x 2.50m Stanley wood burning stove, sideboard, built in display cabinet, patio door to glazed veranda overlooking Dungarvan Bay and surrounding panorama.\n\nBedroom 1\n3.34m x 2.73m Timber flooring, coving\n\nBedroom 2\n3.37m x 2.95m\nMeasurement excludes built in wardrobes Timber flooring, views over Dungarvan Bay\n\nBedroom 3\n3.03m x 2.86m Timber flooring\n\nBathroom\n3.18m x 2.36m Generous shower stall, Electric Shower, Tiled floor, partial tiling to walls, heated towel rail, glass shelf, mirror, window provides for natural ventilation.\n\nGarden Room\n5.58m x 3.26m Timber flooring, Utility off\n\nUtility Room\n4.15m x 0.92m Plumbed for washing machine and Dryer, oil burner, door to rear\n\nGarage\n5.46m x 4.20m Work Bench\n\n\nOutside\n-Garage -Garden Shed -Garden Room"
      },
